September's payroll estimate is 29,000, short of the surveys, and the bureau says that change is not statistically significant
The Bureau of Labor Statistics said that gain and the 4.2 percent unemployment rate both changed little. July and August together are 60,000 lower than previously reported.
+29,000 payrolls in September
